      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{6x}{3x+4}=\\frac{2x-1}{x}$。 （1）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们可以应用分数等于零的条件。为此，将方程（1）写",
        "成：",
        "$\\frac{6x}{3x+4}-\\frac{2x-1}{x}=0$，",
        "再通分，得：",
        "$\\frac{6x^2-(2x-1)(3x+4)}{x(3x+4)}=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个方程和下列方程-不等式组同解：",
        "$\\begin{cases}6x^2-(2x-1)(3x+4)=0,\\\\ ↵ x(3x+4)\\ne0.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "先解其中的方程，再验证所得的根是否满足条件",
        "$x(3x+4)\\ne0$，就可得出方程（1）的解集合。",
        "$6x^2-(2x-1)(3x+4)=0$，",
        "$6x^2-6x^2+3x-8x+4=0$，",
        "$-5x=-4$，",
        "$x=0.8$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$0.8\\times(3\\times0.8+4)\\ne0$，这是真命题。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "答： $\\{0.8\\}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程（1）也可以利用分母相同的分数相等的条件求解："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**分数 $\\frac{a}{c}$ 和 $\\frac{b}{c}$（$a$，$b$ 和 $c$ 是有理数），当且仅当它们的分子**",
        "**相等，而且公分母不等于零时，这两个分数相等，即**",
        "$\\left(\\frac{a}{c}=\\frac{b}{c}\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow(a=b,\\ c\\ne0)$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
